The nearest town is Prince Albert - just 4 km from the northern end of the pass. There is plenty see, from flora to fauna, and some mind boggling geology. The fynbos is at its best in winter and spring with[ prote]as, ericas, rest[ios] and pin-[c]ushions in[ prof]usion.
